{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to Atris - a world of magic and intrigue, where outsiders are summoned through a mysterious ritual and called Heroes. But who are these Heroes, really? And what are they needed for? You\u2019ll have to find out for yourself\u2026 if you survive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3894300/extras/656ed52a20ecc544edc0ed92537e847f.avif?t=1769764514\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Synopsis:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You play as an ordinary guy who, by chance, finds himself in this world, on the continent of Valarion. The locals mistake him for a newly summoned Hero, and every powerful figure seeks to use him for their own ends. To survive, he must adapt - making tough choices, trusting, deceiving, fighting, and winning! But remember: in this world, Heroes are merely tools. Those who become unwanted... quickly disappear.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3894300/extras/7fe30c3a6494c44aede0255eed083456.avif?t=1769764514\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Well-developed, Living World.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Valarion stands on the brink of change: humans rapidly expand their domains, elves are split into two factions, dwarves barricade themselves in their mountains and avoid conflict, beastfolk tribes are driven to the fringes, and demons lurk in the shadows. In the human kingdom of Xanthria, passions run high - intrigues, power struggles, and endless feuds. To consolidate his rule, the king opens a portal and summons Heroes from other worlds....</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3894300/extras/f06deff01c860f30a6ddcc2a05897faa.avif?t=1769764514\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Beautiful ladies with their own goals</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your journey will bring not only battles but also unforgettable encounters. Every woman is a complex individual - with her own personality, secrets, and hidden motives. Build relationships, uncover their mysteries, and win their hearts. But beware: not all of them wish you well.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3894300/extras/fdc5b867243ac18874248e5f0bc3edec.poster.avif?t=1769764514\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3894300/extras/fdc5b867243ac18874248e5f0bc3edec.webm?t=1769764514\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3894300/extras/fdc5b867243ac18874248e5f0bc3edec.mp4?t=1769764514\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>The Choice is Yours.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your decisions shape not only your relationships with characters but the very course of the story. Who will you trust? Who will you betray? Who will you share a night with - and who will you stab in the back?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3894300/extras/b3a7411b0733850b13f7a581d2580e38.avif?t=1769764514\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Fight and Play.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Beyond choices, the game features a turn-based combat system that grows more challenging as the story progresses. Mini-games are also included to add variety to your experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3894300/extras/ddbae0e078f18c77edbb946b970847b1.avif?t=1769764514\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Game Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A detailed, living world filled with conflicts and mysteries. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Challenging (and not-so-challenging) choices that shape your story. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Romantic storylines with captivating ladies. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Numerous erotic and sexual scenes, presented through animated sequences and illustrations. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >High-quality artwork. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Turn-based combat and mini-games.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3894300/extras/476f39c56ddcf0e468dd693085960ad9.poster.avif?t=1769764514\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3894300/extras/476f39c56ddcf0e468dd693085960ad9.webm?t=1769764514\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3894300/extras/476f39c56ddcf0e468dd693085960ad9.mp4?t=1769764514\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Good luck on your adventure, &quot;Hero&quot;. Don\u2019t anger the Demoness!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackgroun